#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:3
msgid "Advanced configuration"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can configure the desktop app through command-line options, "
"``nextcloud.cfg``, and environment variables. Use the app's **Settings** "
"window for options available there; this page describes advanced settings "
"and overrides. For the separate tool that performs a single synchronization "
"run, see :doc:`commandline`."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過命令列選項、``nextcloud.cfg`` "
"及環境變數設定桌面應用程式。一般選項請使用應用程式的「設定」視窗；本頁介紹進階設定及覆寫方式。有關只執行一次同步的獨立工具，請參閱 "
":doc:`commandline`。"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:11
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:13
msgid ""
"Defaults below refer to the standard Nextcloud client. Branded clients, "
"server capabilities, and operating system policies can change some defaults."
" Sync-engine settings apply to classic sync, including Windows virtual "
"files. The macOS File Provider extension handles its own file transfers; "
"these settings do not configure its transfer engine. See "
":doc:`macosfileprovider`."
msgstr ""
"以下默認值適用於標準 Nextcloud 用戶端。品牌版本、伺服器功能及作業系統政策可能會改變部分默認值。同步引擎設定適用於傳統同步，包括 "
"Windows 虛擬檔案。macOS File Provider 擴充功能自行處理檔案傳輸，這些設定不會影響其傳輸引擎。請參閱 "
":doc:`macosfileprovider`。"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:21
msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "命令列選項"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:23
msgid ""
"Start the desktop app with ``nextcloud [options]``. Use ``nextcloud --help``"
" to see the options in your installed version. Options with a value accept "
"both ``--option value`` and ``--option=value``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``nextcloud [options]`` 啟動桌面應用程式。執行 ``nextcloud --help`` "
"可查看已安裝版本的選項。帶有值的選項同時接受 ``--option value`` 及 ``--option=value`` 格式。"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:27
msgid ""
"Quit the running client before applying startup options or environment "
"variables. Starting another instance can forward commands to the existing "
"process instead of starting a new process with the requested environment."
msgstr "套用啟動選項或環境變數前，請先結束正在執行的用戶端。啟動另一個執行個體時，命令可能會轉交給現有程序，而非以指定環境啟動新程序。"

