msgstr "帳戶設定選項"

#: ../../desktop/advanced_configuration.rst:120
msgid ""
"These options create and save an account, then exit. Start the desktop app "
"again to use the account."
msgstr "這些選項會建立並儲存帳戶，然後結束。請重新啟動桌面應用程式以使用該帳戶。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:11
